address'. A one-token memory recognizes 'address of/the', split inflections,
and complements of 'for': seeking/accounting attenuate it, while asking and
responsible/grateful reverse it. Code-like 'for' is stronger. URL spellings,
handling verbs and several translations have weaker negative responses.
Other tokens are approximated by zero; document boundaries reset memory.
