    text binary unicode input output depth read write reading writing sorted
    file buffer buffers csv 输入 输出 读取 压缩 读'''.split())
DETERMINERS = set('our your their my his her this the'.split())
IO_TERMS = set('''read write reading writing csv raw grayscale data input
    output binary bytes memory'''.split())
PAYLOAD_WORDS = set('''file files image images buffer buffers format formats
    record records'''.split())


